            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors in 145 patients with combined atherosclerotic lesion of the coronary arteries, abdominal aorta and vessels of the lower extremities performed the one-stage, staged operations, aortocoronary shunting alone, the vascular operations alone. The total lethality was 7.6%, the postoperative--6.3%.</AbstractText>
